To generating opcode file and description files for PowerPC, for example.
Please run the following commands.
In detail, see info files and ${PREFIX}/share/cgen/Makefile.in .

$ guile -l ${PREFIX}/share/cgen/guile.scm \
  -s ${PREFIX}/share/cgen/cgen-opc.scm \
  -s ${PREFIX}/share/cgen \
  -v \
  -a ${PREFIX}/share/cgen/cpu/powerpc.cpu \
  -i "all" \
  -m "all" \
  -H powerpc-desc.h \
  -C powerpc-desc.c

$ guile -l ${PREFIX}/share/cgen/guile.scm \
  -s ${PREFIX}/share/cgen/cgen-doc.scm \
  -s ${PREFIX}/share/cgen \
  -v \
  -a ${PREFIX}/share/cgen/cpu/powerpc.cpu \
  -H powerpc.html \
  -I powerpc-insn.html  
